[ ] Add request logging (different verbosity for dev/prod)
[ ] Validate all user‑supplied data (celebrate/Joi or express-validator)
[ ] Central error‑handler that hides stack traces in production
[ ] Graceful shutdown on SIGTERM/SIGINT
[ ] Global listeners for unhandledRejection / uncaughtException
[ ] Load config from environment (port, NODE_ENV, allowed origins)
[ ] Run npm audit & keep dependencies up‑to‑date
```

