## 3. Security‑Best‑Practice Checklist

| ✅ | Item | Why it matters |
|---|------|----------------|
| **Helmet** | Sets HTTP security headers (Content‑Security‑Policy, X‑Frame‑Options, etc.) |
| **CORS** | Restricts which origins can call your API. In production replace `*` with a whitelist. |
| **Rate limiting** | Thwarts brute‑force and denial‑of‑service attempts. |
