## 5. Miscellaneous Best Practices

| Practice | Reason |
|----------|--------|
| **Read config from environment variables** (`process.env.PORT`, `process.env.NODE_ENV`) | Keeps secrets out of code, supports different environments |
| **Graceful shutdown** (`process.on('SIGTERM', …)`) | Allows pending requests to finish, avoids abrupt termination |
| **Catch unhandled rejections / uncaught exceptions** | Prevents the application from silently dying | 
| **Enable `trust proxy` only when behind a trusted reverse proxy** | Required for correct client‑IP handling when using rate‑limit or secure cookies |
| **Use HTTPS (terminate at reverse proxy) and set `secure` cookie flag** | Defends against MITM and session hijacking |

```js
// Graceful shutdown example
process.on('SIGTERM', () => {
  console.log('SIGTERM received – closing HTTP server');
  server.close(() => {
    console.log('HTTP server closed');
    process.exit(0);
  });
});
```

