## 1️⃣ Error‑Handling Improvements

| Issue | Why it matters | Recommended fix |
|------|----------------|-----------------|
| No global error‑handling middleware | Uncaught exceptions or rejected promises will crash the process or leak stack traces to the client. | Add an `errorHandler(err, req, res, next)` middleware that logs the error (but never returns internal details) and sends a generic JSON error response. |
