## 1.  General structure – add a “centralised” error‑handling layer  

```js
// ---------------------------------------------------------------
// 1️⃣  Top‑level imports (add security & logging middleware)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------
const express   = require('express');
const helmet    = require('helmet');          // security headers
const cors      = require('cors');            // controlled CORS
const morgan    = require('morgan');          // request logging
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit'); // DoS protection
const createError = require('http-errors');   // easy error creation

